son Last 16 (e3):\n- Bingham (winner): 50s=3, 60s=0, 70s=3, 80s=0, 90s=1, 100s=1 → doesn't match\n- Wilson (loser): 50s=2, 60s=1, 70s=1, 80s=1, 90s=1, 100s=1 → doesn't match\n\nLet me check the Higgins-Saengkham Last 16 (e3):\n- Higgins (winner): 50s=1, 60s=3, 70s=0, 80s=1, 90s=2, 100s=2 → doesn't match (needs two 70s)\n\nLet me check the Bingtao-Selby Last 16 (e3):\n- Selby (winner): 50s=4, 60s=1, 70s=0, 80s=3, 90s=0, 100s=3 → doesn't match\n\nNone of the 2022 matches match. I need to find the 2021 World Championship. Let me search for the cuetracker page.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"cuetracker.net world championship 2021 selby murphy breaks\", \"2021 world snooker championship final selby 18 murphy 15 frame scores breaks\", \"cuetracker 2021 world championship quarter final breaks table\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_da084b485ee444c2ac122010","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.olbg.com/blogs/snooker-maximum-breaks\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d38\"},\"ref\":\"d38\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://wpbsa.com/about-us/history/147-breaks/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Selby\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\"