hp?f=722&t=13431\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.snookerisland.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=25&t=11961\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.sportingnews.com/in/snooker/news/2022-world-snooker-championship-schedule-what-todays-order-play/ukx6rk3n5lnncnkl9lcw5txh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Championship_League_(invitational)\"}],\"next_step\":\"Open a received ref with read; use replay=true to restore full cached navigation.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":11,\"prior_deliveries\":1,\"query_key\":\"7d229d0e159243814c5bdd06ec8197b4adcb5829c702b30b963cd18586477328\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"775086849da4435278f9f56a9efbd66b340c652ea93e37ddcbc01801e9200bad\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"2021 world snooker championship final selby 18 murphy 15 frame scores breaks\",\"view\":\"reuse\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... O'Sullivan made his 1,100th century on 22 March 2021, in his quarter-final match at the 2021 Tour Championship against John Higgins. His 1,200th century came in a second-round match against Hossein Vafaei at the 2023 World Snooker Championship. At the 2022 Scottish Open ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_and_century_breaks_made_by_Ronnie_O%27Sullivan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... Participants\\n\\nThe event featured the 16 players who were placed highest in the world rankings after the UK Championship in December 2021. The defending champion was Yan Bingtao, who won the 2021 Masters with a 10–8 victory over John Higgins in the final. Yan was seeded first ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Masters_(snooker)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... He defeated Mark Williams 13–3 in the quarter-finals and Alan McManus 17–11 in the semi-final, during which he set a new record of seven century breaks, the most scored by a single player in a World Championship match at the Crucible Theatre. With this ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ding_Junhui\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... Afterwards, he exited both the Welsh Open and the Players Championship at the quarter-final stage, then the 2021 Tour Championship with one more semi-final defeat by Neil Robertson, repeating his last year results for all three events.\\n\\nSelby won his fourth world title in May 2021 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Selby\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ranking event\\ntotal prize fund: £2, 395, 000\\nwinners_share: £500, 000\\nhighest_break: (147), (147)\\nwinner: Ronnie O'Sullivan ENG\\nrunner_up: Judd Trump ENG\\nscore: 18–13\\nprevious: 2021\\nnext: 2023\\n\\nThe 2022 World Snooker Championship (officially the 2022 Betfred World Snooker Championship) was a professional ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_World_Snooker_Championship\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... He defeated long-term rival Higgins 137 in the second round of the 2021 World Championship, before losing 313 in the quarter-finals to Selby. During the championship, Williams caused some controversy by gently rolling his break shot off the bottom cushion so the cue ball would nestle ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Williams_%28snooker_player%29\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ireland Championship for at least one season.\\n\\n**Table 14**\\n\\n| County | App. | Debut | Most recent | Championship titles | Last championship title | Best All-Ireland result |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| border|20x20px Antrim | | 1900 | 2025 | 0 | — | Runners-up |\\n| border|20x20px Armagh | | 1946 | — | 0 | — | Ulster runners-up |\\n| border|20x20px Carlow | | 1963 | 2025 | 0 | — | Quarter-fi\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All-Ireland_Senior_Hurling_Championship\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1996 the tournament expanded to 16 teams, since it was easier for European nations to qualify for the World Cup than their own continental championship; 14 of the 24 teams at the 1982, 1986 and 1990 World Cups had been European, whereas the European Championship finals still ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UEFA_European_Championship\"},{\"kind\":\